  "sourceNotes": "Pasta e fagioli is one of the oldest dishes in the Italian cucina povera tradition. Every region has its own version, but the Venetian and Neapolitan styles are the most celebrated. Pancetta and rosemary are the defining flavour notes in the northern variant.",
